    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n5228" root="جدع" body-key="j">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَدَعَةٌ</span></b>  <i>What remains, of the nose, ear, hand</i> or
<i>arm,</i> or <i>lip, after the cutting off</i> [<i>of the rest</i>]:
(S, K:) the <i>place of the cutting off thereof;</i> like
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَرَجَةٌ</span> from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الأَعْرَجُ</span>, and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَطَعَةٌ</span> from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الأَقْطَعُ</span>. (TA.)

